+From 8fd3c880f26daae46f8d8eaf86a70dbabf256f4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: vishnubedi3 <309025711+vishnubedi3@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:17:17 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Master Prompt IV: portable attestations + baselined
+ release machinery
+
+- _attestation_key no longer binds to the absolute workspace path: the
+  path binding broke fresh-clone verification without adding security
+  (key is tamper-evidence, not a secret). HMAC tamper-evidence preserved.
+- Baseline now covers release/verification machinery (release, attest,
+  provenance, sbom, audit_pack, spec, certify, ledger, store, signing,
+  replay): quiet weakening of any verifier drifts the baseline.
+- Tests: machinery-tampering detection + cross-path attestation portability.
+
+NOTE: this commit intentionally leaves release/ stale (key rotation);
+re-certified in the following evidence commit.
+
+Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
+---
